    "fullSolution": "**Find volume:** Revolve $y=\\sqrt{x}$ from $x=0$ to $x=4$ around $x$-axis\\n\\n**Disk method:** $V = \\pi\\int_a^b [R(x)]^2 dx$\\n\\n**Radius:** $R(x) = \\sqrt{x}$ (distance from $x$-axis to curve)\\n\\n**Set up:**\\n$$V = \\pi\\int_0^4 (\\sqrt{x})^2 dx = \\pi\\int_0^4 x\\, dx$$\\n\\n**Evaluate:**\\n$$V = \\pi\\left[\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right]_0^4 = \\pi\\left(\\frac{16}{2}-0\\right) = 8\\pi$$\\n\\n**Answer: $8\\pi$ cubic units**",
